  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/nh-rsa-data/blob/96bd0a247d4463e2ae692310c0fdd17ec563a46c/rsa_html/V/80/80-50.htm",
  "statuteText": "80:50 Collection by Suit. –\n\nThe selectmen of any town, or the tax collector, by action brought in the name of the collector, may cause any tax to be collected by suit at law or bill in equity, and may trustee wages or other moneys for any tax, and in such action there shall be no exemption from attachment of wages in any amount."
